<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Ramon Marques | Corretor de Imóveis</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --white:#FFFFFF; --bg:#FAF8F7; --wine:#6E1423; --wine-dark:#4A0E17;
    --wine-soft:#F3E4E7; --ink:#211416; --muted:#6E5C5F;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
    padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
  }
  html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);}
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--white); color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;}

  /* ---------- HEADER ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:var(--white);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(110,20,35,0.15);
    padding:calc(1rem + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)) 6vw 1rem;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:flex-end;
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .brand svg{ width:28px; height:28px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .brand-text{ text-align:right; line-height:1.1; }
  .brand-text .b1{ font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--wine); letter-spacing:0.01em; }
  .brand-text .b2{ font-size:0.68rem; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:var(--muted); }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative; min-height:88vh;
    display:flex; align-items:center;
    padding:3rem 6vw;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-bg{
    position:absolute; inset:-4%;
    background-image:url('data:image/png;base64,');
    background-size:cover; background-position:center 28%;
    filter: blur(10px) brightness(0.92) saturate(0.95);
    transform:scale(1.1);
  }
  .hero-scrim{
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(74,14,23,0.82) 0%, rgba(74,14,23,0.55) 42%, rgba(110,20,35,0.35) 75%, rgba(110,20,35,0.15) 100%);
  }
  .hero-content{ position:relative; z-index:2; max-width:660px; color:var(--white); }
  .hero p.eyebrow{
    font-size:0.85rem; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#F1D9DC;
    animation:rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.2rem);
    line-height:0.98; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    margin:0.5rem 0 1.2rem;
    animation:rise 0.85s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; animation-delay:0.08s;
  }
  .hero p.lede{
    font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.6; color:#F5E9EB; max-width:480px;
    animation:rise 0.85s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; animation-delay:0.18s;
  }
  .hero-cta{
    margin-top:2.1rem; display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;
    animation:rise 0.85s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; animation-delay:0.28s;
  }
  .btn{
    padding:14px 26px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem;
    text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    transition:transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-primary{ background:var(--white); color:var(--wine); }
  .btn-ghost{ border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.55); color:var(--white); }
  @keyframes rise{ from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(16px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .eyebrow,h1,.lede,.hero-cta{animation:none;} }

  /* ---------- STRIP ---------- */
  .strip{
    display:flex; gap:2.6rem; flex-wrap:wrap;
    padding:2.6rem 6vw; border-bottom:1px solid var(--wine-soft);
  }
  .stat b{ font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:1.9rem; color:var(--wine); display:block; }
  .stat span{ font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--muted); }

  /* ---------- REVIEWS ---------- */
  .section{ padding:4.5rem 6vw; background:var(--bg); }
  .section h2{ font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.3rem); font-weight:600; max-width:540px; margin-bottom:2.4rem; color:var(--ink); }
  .grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(270px,1fr)); gap:1.3rem; }
  .card{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--wine-soft);
    border-left:3px solid var(--wine);
    border-radius:6px; padding:1.6rem;
  }
  .card p{ color:#4B3A3C; line-height:1.55; font-size:0.95rem; }
  .card .name{ margin-top:1rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--wine); font-size:0.85rem; }
  .stars{ color:var(--wine); letter-spacing:2px; margin-bottom:0.8rem; font-size:0.9rem; }

  /* ---------- CONTACT ---------- */
  .contact{ background:var(--white); text-align:center; }
  .contact h2{ margin:0 auto 1rem; }
  .contact p{ color:var(--muted); max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 2rem; }
  footer{ padding:2rem 6vw; text-align:center; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem; border-top:1px solid var(--wine-soft); }

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .hero{ padding:5rem 6vw 3rem; min-height:80vh; }
    .strip{ gap:1.6rem; }
    header{ justify-content:flex-end; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M3 11L12 3L21 11" stroke="#6E1423" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M5.5 9.5V20H18.5V9.5" stroke="#6E1423" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M9.5 20V14H14.5V20" stroke="#6E1423" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="brand-text">
      <div class="b1">RAMON MARQUES</div>
      <div class="b2">CORRETOR DE IMÓVEIS</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">★ 5.0 · 50 avaliações no Google</p>
    <h1>Ramon Marques</h1>
    <p class="lede">Corretor de imóveis em Florianópolis, com atendimento próximo e transparente do início ao fechamento do negócio.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+5548984320076">Falar com Ramon</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#avaliacoes">Ver avaliações</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="strip">
  <div class="stat"><b>5.0</b><span>nota média no Google</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>50</b><span>avaliações de clientes</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>8h–20h</b><span>atendimento todos os dias</span></div>
</div>

<section class="section" id="avaliacoes">
  <h2>O que os clientes dizem sobre o atendimento</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p>Ramon é reconhecido pela educação, dedicação e honestidade em cada etapa do trabalho, tratando cada cliente com respeito e transparência.</p>
      <div class="name">Avaliação no Google</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p>Corretor atencioso, que sana as dúvidas do cliente e oferece atendimento personalizado, sempre buscando a melhor oferta disponível.</p>
      <div class="name">Avaliação no Google</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p>"Top d+", "Top !" — comentários rápidos que resumem a satisfação de quem já negociou com o Ramon.</p>
      <div class="name">Avaliação no Google</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact">
  <h2>Vamos encontrar seu próximo imóvel?</h2>
  <p>Atendimento em Ingleses Norte e em toda Florianópolis, de segunda a domingo, das 8h às 20h.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content:center;">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+5548984320076" style="background:var(--wine); color:var(--white);">📞 (48) 98432-0076</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://wa.me/5548984320076" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="border-color:var(--wine); color:var(--wine);">WhatsApp</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>Ramon Marques · Corretor de Imóveis · R. do Engenho Novo, 377 — Ingleses Norte, Florianópolis - SC</footer>

</body>
</html>
